   "resumo_en": "Chuck is the twentieth and final studio album by American rock and roll singer and guitarist Chuck Berry, released in June 2017. Berry died between the announcement of its recording on his 90th birthday in October 2016 and its release. It posthumously became his first UK Top 10 chart entry since 1977, debuting at No. 9. It was the first Berry studio album to be released in 38 years. The album was positively received by critics who considered it a return to form and a poignant last statement.",
